  FROM test_versioned_dirty_scan('tmp_doc', '&&(anyarray,anyarray)', '{2,3}'::int4[]);
 locator | v0 | recheck 
---------+----+---------
 (0,1)   | t  | t
 (0,1)   | f  | t
 (0,1)   | f  | t
